    "observed_first_failure_telemetry_was_non_null": true,
    "native_guard": "if (space == nullptr || space->is_stepping()) { return Variant(); }",
    "actual_callback_timing": "Godot dispatches the custom integration callback from JoltSpace3D::call_queries during PhysicsServer3D::flush_queries after the preceding JoltSpace3D::step returned and cleared stepping, before the next PhysicsServer3D::step begins.",
    "callback_order_proof": [
      "JoltSpace3D::step sets stepping true before pre_step and the physics update.",
      "JoltBody3D::pre_step enqueues bodies with custom integration callbacks; it does not invoke the script callback.",
      "JoltSpace3D::step clears stepping before returning.",
      "At the beginning of the next Godot physics-loop iteration, Main::iteration calls PhysicsServer3D::flush_queries before the later PhysicsServer3D::step.",
      "JoltPhysicsServer3D::flush_queries calls JoltSpace3D::call_queries, which calls JoltBody3D::call_queries and only then invokes the custom integration callback.",
      "The R24D7 probe therefore called hinge_joint_get_motor_telemetry while space->is_stepping() was false."
    ],
